{"ID":"20240205153922-itz29jf","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240205153922-itz29jf","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205153922-itz29jf\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206104415-jij04pf\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240620080435-mbyx4r7\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:1400,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240620080435-mbyx4r7\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:4,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:4\u0026#125;","title":"薄荷","type":"doc","updated":"20240902173121"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206104415-jij04pf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206104415-jij04pf","updated":"20240206104433"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产于安徽、江苏、江西、四川等地。\n【性状】\t本品茎呈方柱形，有对生分枝，长1540cm，直径0.20.4cm；表面紫棕色或淡绿色，棱角处具茸毛，节间长25cm；质脆，断面白色，髓部中空。叶对生，有短柄；叶片皱缩卷曲，完整者展平后呈宽披针形、长椭圆形或卵形，长27cm，宽1"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBackslashContent","Data":"~"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3cm；上表面深绿色，下表面灰绿色，稀被茸毛，有凹点状腺鳞。轮伞花序腋生，花萼钟状，先端5齿裂，花冠淡紫色。揉搓后有特殊清凉香气，味辛凉。\n【性味】\t辛，凉。\n【功效】\t疏散风热，清利头目，透疹。具有疏散风热、清利头目、利咽、透疹、疏肝解郁之功效。现代医学常将其用于治疗风热感冒、头痛、咽喉痛、口舌生疮、风疹、麻疹、胸腹胀闷和抗早孕等。另外，薄荷还具有消炎止痛作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240206104416-jrnwwu1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206104416-jrnwwu1","updated":"20240206104416"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206104416-o0ir18g.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240205154847-1xvszoc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205154847-1xvszoc","updated":"20240205154847"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeL